  "boundaries": [
    "These files cross-compiled on macOS; the new WPF layout and controls require their own native run.",
    "Portable controls do not execute WPF, physical input, native dialogs or WASAPI playback.",
    "Fader labels follow the existing application linear-dB slider, using actual Track/Thumb geometry. No undocumented reference taper is claimed.",
    "Existing published preview1 remains tied to commit6a6f4d4; this follow-up does not replace or amend that evidence."
  ],
  "observation": "Selected Channel and Inspector plates share selection; the Channel strip uses the same gain/pan/mute/solo/history as the lower mixer. Native checks exercise both controls, value entry, invalid input, cancellation, and tick/thumb alignment at minimum, zero and maximum. Independently authored vector toolbar and compact event/transport fields retain their original commands."
